Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Note,,0,0,0,,--------------- Insert --------------
Dialogue: 3,1:30:51.38,1:30:57.87,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}はなればなれ　もう　慣れっこなの
Dialogue: 3,1:30:58.73,1:31:04.88,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}友達もできた　素敵な仲間
Dialogue: 3,1:31:05.69,1:31:12.18,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}強い子のふり　してたけど
Dialogue: 3,1:31:12.18,1:31:19.35,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}こころ　ぽつり　寂しそうなの
Dialogue: 3,1:31:19.35,1:31:26.49,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}願いごとを　囁いたら
Dialogue: 3,1:31:26.49,1:31:34.16,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}それはきっと　まるで　祈りのように
Dialogue: 3,1:31:35.05,1:31:42.16,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}そばにいたい　もっと近づいて
Dialogue: 3,1:31:42.16,1:31:50.14,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}ほら　わたし　勇気だして
Dialogue: 3,1:31:50.14,1:31:57.47,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}抱きしめたい　大切な人
Dialogue: 3,1:31:57.47,1:32:04.58,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}ぬくもりが　満たしていく
Dialogue: 3,1:32:04.90,1:32:17.02,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}寂しい　こころを
Dialogue: 4,1:30:51.38,1:30:57.87,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}悲歡離合  早已習以為常
Dialogue: 4,1:30:58.73,1:31:04.88,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}結識了朋友  優秀的伙伴
Dialogue: 4,1:31:05.69,1:31:12.18,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}一直以來  故作堅強
Dialogue: 4,1:31:12.18,1:31:19.35,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}心底卻  悄然  泛起寂寞
Dialogue: 4,1:31:19.35,1:31:26.49,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}當我輕聲  唸出心願
Dialogue: 4,1:31:26.49,1:31:34.16,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}那願望  定會  化作祈禱
Dialogue: 4,1:31:35.05,1:31:42.16,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}想待在你身邊  想再靠近些
Dialogue: 4,1:31:42.16,1:31:50.14,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}看啊  我呀  鼓起勇氣了
Dialogue: 4,1:31:50.14,1:31:57.47,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}好想擁抱你啊  我重視的人
Dialogue: 4,1:31:57.47,1:32:04.58,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}一股暖流  正逐漸填滿
Dialogue: 4,1:32:04.90,1:32:17.02,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}填滿  寂寞的心房
